Note on bundled third-party components:

This repository vendors several baseline memory systems under `system/` (e.g.,
O-Mem, MemBox, MemoryOS, MemOS, TiMem, General Agentic Memory). Each of those
projects retains its own original copyright and license terms; see the README
and LICENSE files inside the respective `system/<name>/` directories. The MIT
license above applies only to the first-party code authored for the EvalMem
framework (everything outside `system/`).
